@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/files/
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "Controller is RestAlchemy" as API
database "Configure the file storage" as STORE
database "Metadata from the file + ACL - What ? PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "It 's a transaction . outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact file scope" as TASK
participant "The worker pool ." as WORKER
database "The public events repository" as EVENT
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISP
participant "Signed client" as WS
Client -> API: POST JSON or multipart
API -> STORE: Save bytes + associated metadata (multipart)
API -> DB: BEGIN; I want to insert metadata . + ACL
API -> OUT: I 'm going to add file.created
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201 JSON metadata from
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
TASK -> WORKER: I 'm gonna take the job .
WORKER -> EVENT: Get ready to insert file.created
DISP -> EVENT: read/repeat/play
DISP -> WS: file.created
@enduml
